5,0,1,talk,Minato,,"Hello everyone. I am Minato. I am a little nervous, but I hope we can all be friends and find the truth together.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,Good morning. I am Benjamin. Let us proceed with logic and calm. I trust we will find the truth together.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, friends. I am Servas. Let us listen with open hearts and seek wisdom together.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,Hi everyone! I'm May. Let's keep things fun and friendly while we figure out who's hiding in the shadows.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,Hey! I'm Takumi. I'm ready to protect my friends. Let's find the wolf and win this game together!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,I am curious about how we will find the wolf. I hope we can all be kind to each other while we talk.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I appreciate the optimism. However, kindness alone will not expose the wolf. We must observe carefully and question inconsistencies.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,"I agree with Benjamin. Observation is key. Let us watch for subtle shifts in behavior, for truth often hides in silence.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,"I love the energy! But let's not get too serious. @Benjamin, are you the Seer? I need to know who to trust.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@May, I don't know who the Seer is yet. But I will watch everyone closely. If anyone acts suspicious, I will call them out!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,I am listening to everyone. I do not know who the Seer is yet. I just want us to be safe and happy.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, I will not confirm or deny my role. Premature revelation is a tactical error. Let us observe the night's events first.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Servas,,I respect Benjamin's caution. Wisdom often lies in patience. Let us trust the process and the night to reveal what daylight conceals.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,May,,"Fair enough, Benjamin. I'll keep my eyes open. @Minato, your kindness is sweet, but we need to stay sharp to survive.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, I appreciate your kindness, but we need to be tough. I will not let the wolf hurt my friends. Let's stay alert!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minato,,"I will try my best to be helpful. Goodnight, everyone. I hope we all sleep well and wake up safe.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,Goodnight. Let the night reveal its secrets. I will process the information carefully.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
